We are urgently looking for a REMOTE Senior Fullstack Developer - Blockchain Environment for an international Blockchain organization in Australia/NZ. Candidates need to be fluent in English.

Candidates need to be able to work 4-5 hours per day in the normal office hours of Australia/NZ.

The technical team are experts in designing, developing, deploying, and maintaining products built on the PL^G Blockchain framework, the NodeJS runtime, React and other relevant technologies. The teams are critical in delivering our platform and products.

Tasks and responsibilities:

• Develop software to meet agreed technical and design specifications to a high-quality and maintaining the Platform Components, with little supervision;

• Developing with other technologies where necessary and reasonable to achieve the company mission;

• Contribute to business requirements and technical specification documents;  

• Make contributions to product architecture;

• Effectively review other developers’ code;

• Thoroughly test software and logs defects including - Unit Tests, Integration Tests, Performance Testing;

• Provide on-call support to applications in production when necessary;

• Create Intellectual Property;

Profile:

​

• Bachelor or Master degree;

• +2/3 years of experience with JavaScript/Front-End Java development

• Skilled in relevant programming languages and technologies e.g. Javascript, Typescript, NodeJS, REST, React and Blockchain JavaScript API;

• Experience working with relevant frameworks, databases, tools and testing programmes;

• Experience with Docker and/or Kubernetes;

• Experience with Unit Tests, Integration Tests, Performance Testing;

• Experience in deploying Blockchain infrastructure;

• Understanding of Blockchain technology;

• Strong passion for and understanding of decentralized technologies;

Offered:

A challenging role for an international Blockchain organization in Australia/NZ;

Indefinite, long-term contract;

Attractive salary package;

Interested :

If you have the determination for a rewarding career, please send your CV to us via or call us on +94 114312515 for more information.

